{"title":"All products","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"postevand-carton","title":"Postevand Carton","description":"\u003cp\u003e100% Danish tap water and plant-based packaging. Danish tap water is recognised as some of the world's best drinking water. At least 96% of our carton originates as plants. The result: a packaging that starts with plants and ends with lower climate impact.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Postevand","offers":[{"title":"0.33L \/ Box of 24","offer_id":40007595655234,"sku":"55527","price":156.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":true},{"title":"0.50L \/ Box of 24","offer_id":40007595688002,"sku":"30473","price":168.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1721\/2643\/files\/330mlfront-new_e1c92410-3abe-43ba-bc3e-4d8f1fd781a5.png?v=1754943482"},{"product_id":"postevand-x-sigg-bottle","title":"Postevand x SIGG Bottle","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur reusable bottle is a collaboration with Swiss company SIGG. The bottle is made in Switzerland from one piece of high-quality recycled aluminium sourced in Europe. It is lightweight, durable and free from harmful chemicals including BPA and phthalates. It is made to stay with you for a lifetime and keep you hydrated when you are far away from the tap.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSIGG has been producing high-quality aluminium products since 1908. Since 1993, one of their lightweight and reusable aluminium bottles has been displayed at MoMA in New York.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Postevand","offers":[{"title":"0.40L \/ Aluminium","offer_id":46982181912911,"sku":"56096","price":149.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1721\/2643\/products\/Sigg-bottle.png?v=1664492987"},{"product_id":"postevand-x-forlaget-virkelig","title":"Postevand x Forlaget Virkelig","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIn this special release you get to discover the captivating work of Kim Stanley Robinson, an acclaimed American science fiction author. Time Magazine recognized him as a \"Hero of the Environment\" for his visionary storytelling, ecological consciousness, and future-historical perspectives.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eIn 2021, Robinson was invited to COP26, where he contributed with the text \"Remembering Climate Change - A Message from the Year 2071.\" This powerful narrative reveals how humanity confronted the climate crisis and took charge of the biosphere. Now, this impactful story is available in Danish translation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e","brand":"Postevand","offers":[{"title":"One Size","offer_id":46987804836175,"sku":"","price":85.0,"currency_code":"DKK","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1721\/2643\/files\/BookFront.png?v=1690969235"}],"url":"https:\/\/postevand.com\/collections\/all-products.oembed","provider":"Postevand","version":"1.0","type":"link"}